/* ============================================================
   Roomstories — item & room data
   ============================================================
   This file is pure data: every background/room layout and every
   placeable item, with no game logic in it at all. It's loaded by
   index.html BEFORE the main game script, so ASSET_BASE, ITEMS,
   BACKGROUNDS etc. already exist as plain globals by the time the
   engine starts using them — nothing else needs to change to use
   this split.

   Adding new items/rooms only ever means editing THIS file.
   ============================================================ */

